    "body": "> Battery module has no test. I think it is better to add tests to the module.\n\nThat's for sure but for that to happen we need to somehow mock battery crate output. And then you need a mechanism for setting those mocked values as we do with mocked environment variables which makes me think it should live as part of the context implementation.",
